---
import '../assets/admin.css';
---

<div class="admin-shell">
	<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Admin navigation">
		<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Astro CMS home"><span class="brand-symbol">A</span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>Astro CMS</strong><small>LOCAL CONTENT STUDIO</small></span></a>
		<div class="site-picker"><span class="site-avatar">AS</span><span class="site-copy"><small>WORKSPACE</small><strong>Astro site</strong></span><span class="site-chevron">⌄</span></div>
		<div class="nav-label">CONTENT</div>
		<nav class="side-nav" aria-label="Content sections">
			<button class="nav-item is-active" type="button" data-view="overview" aria-current="page"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="5" height="5" rx="1"/><rect x="12" y="3" width="5" height="5" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="12" width="5" height="5" rx="1"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="5" height="5" rx="1"/></svg><span>Overview</span></button>
			<button class="nav-item" type="button" data-view="menus"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h12M4 10h12M4 15h12"/><circle cx="2.5" cy="5" r=".6"/><circle cx="2.5" cy="10" r=".6"/><circle cx="2.5" cy="15" r=".6"/></svg><span>Menus</span><span class="nav-count">1</span></button>
			<button class="nav-item" type="button" data-view="blog"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 2.8h6l4 4v10.4H5z"/><path d="M11 3v4h4M7.5 11h5M7.5 14h5"/></svg><span>Blog posts</span><span class="nav-count">3</span></button>
			<button class="nav-item" type="button" data-view="content"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3.5h12v13H4zM7 7h6M7 10h6M7 13h4"/></svg><span>Content</span><span class="nav-count">2</span></button>
		</nav>
		<div class="nav-label nav-label-git">LOCAL GIT</div>
		<nav class="side-nav side-nav-git" aria-label="Git workspace"><button class="nav-item" type="button" data-view="commits"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="4" r="2"/><circle cx="15" cy="16" r="2"/><circle cx="15" cy="4" r="2"/><path d="M5 6v3a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3"/></svg><span>Commit history</span><span class="nav-count nav-count-blue" data-commit-count>3</span></button></nav>
		<div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="snapshot-card"><div class="snapshot-title"><span></span>BUILD SNAPSHOT</div><strong>main</strong><div class="snapshot-sha">HEAD <code>6f3a2c1</code></div><div class="snapshot-note">Clean at build time</div></div><div class="profile-row"><span class="profile-avatar">AL</span><span><strong>Alex Lee</strong><small>Local editor</small></span></div></div>
	</aside>

	<main class="main-panel">
		<header class="topbar"><div class="crumbs"><span>Astro site</span><span class="crumb-divider">/</span><strong data-breadcrumb>Overview</strong></div><div class="topbar-actions"><span class="local-badge"><i></i>Local repository</span><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-action="download"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v9m0 0 3-3m-3 3L7 9M4 14v3h12v-3"/></svg>Download repository</button></div></header>
		<div class="prototype-banner" role="status"><span class="mock-pill">UX MOCK</span><span>Browser commits and repository downloads are simulated; no remote requests are made.</span><button type="button" data-action="flow-help">How publishing works <span>→</span></button></div>
		<div class="page-body">
			<section class="view-screen" data-screen="overview">
				<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL CONTENT WORKSPACE</p><h1>Your site, ready to edit.</h1><p class="subheading">A browser editor for the Git repository snapshot from your last build.</p></div><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-view="menus">Open editor <span>→</span></button></div>
				<div class="snapshot-card-main card"><div class="snapshot-main"><span class="snapshot-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3.5h9l5 5v12H5z"/><path d="M14 4v5h5M8 13h8M8 16h6"/></svg></span><div><p class="eyebrow">EMBEDDED REPOSITORY</p><h2>Astro site</h2><p>Current local Git repository packaged at build time.</p></div></div><div class="snapshot-metadata"><div><span>BRANCH</span><strong><i>⑂</i> main</strong></div><div><span>BASE COMMIT</span><strong><code>6f3a2c1</code></strong></div><div><span>BUILT</span><strong>Today, 10:42 AM</strong></div><div><span>REMOTE</span><strong class="muted-value">Not contacted</strong></div></div><div class="snapshot-footer"><span><i class="success-dot"></i> Snapshot ready in this browser</span><button class="text-link" type="button" data-view="commits">View commit history <span>→</span></button></div></div>
				<div class="workflow-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WORKFLOW</p><h2>Edit here. Push from your console.</h2></div><span>No remote credentials in the browser</span></div>
				<div class="workflow-grid"><article class="workflow-card"><span class="step-number">01</span><span class="workflow-icon violet"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3.5h12v13H4zM7 7h6M7 10h6M7 13h4"/></svg></span><h3>Edit content</h3><p>Change menu YAML, blog posts, and Markdown pages in a plain text editor.</p><button class="text-link" type="button" data-view="menus">Start editing <span>→</span></button></article><article class="workflow-card"><span class="step-number">02</span><span class="workflow-icon green"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="4" r="2"/><circle cx="15" cy="16" r="2"/><circle cx="15" cy="4" r="2"/><path d="M5 6v3a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3"/></svg></span><h3>Commit locally</h3><p>Create one or more commits in the browser. They stay in this local Git copy.</p><button class="text-link" type="button" data-view="commits">Review commits <span>→</span></button></article><article class="workflow-card"><span class="step-number">03</span><span class="workflow-icon amber"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v9m0 0 3-3m-3 3L7 9M4 14v3h12v-3"/></svg></span><h3>Download &amp; push</h3><p>Export the working repository, then push it with native Git in your console.</p><button class="text-link" type="button" data-action="download">See export details <span>→</span></button></article></div>
				<div class="overview-bottom-grid"><article class="card recent-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTENT</p><h2>Recently edited</h2></div><button class="text-link" type="button" data-view="blog">Browse content <span>→</span></button></div><button class="recent-file" type="button" data-open-file="src/content/blog/field-notes.md"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span><strong>Field notes: spring</strong><small>src/content/blog/field-notes.md</small></span><span class="recent-time">2 days ago</span></button><button class="recent-file" type="button" data-open-file="src/data/menus/main.yaml"><span class="file-mark yaml-mark">Y</span><span><strong>Main navigation</strong><small>src/data/menus/main.yaml</small></span><span class="recent-time">4 days ago</span></button><button class="recent-file" type="button" data-open-file="src/content/pages/about.md"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span><strong>About</strong><small>src/content/pages/about.md</small></span><span class="recent-time">1 week ago</span></button></article><article class="card next-step-card"><p class="eyebrow">AFTER EXPORT</p><h2>Push with your usual Git tools</h2><p>The downloaded ZIP contains a local `.git` repository and its working files. The browser never contacts the remote.</p><div class="command-preview"><span>$</span> git push origin main</div><button class="text-link" type="button" data-action="flow-help">View console steps <span>→</span></button></article></div>
			</section>

			<section class="view-screen" data-screen="editor" hidden><div class="page-heading editor-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTENT EDITOR</p><h1 data-editor-heading>Menus</h1><p class="subheading" data-editor-description>Edit files in the embedded Git working copy.</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-action="new-file"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14"/></svg>New file</button><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-action="download"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v9m0 0 3-3m-3 3L7 9M4 14v3h12v-3"/></svg>Download repo</button></div></div>
				<div class="category-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Content type"><button class="category-tab is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-category="menus">Menus <span>1</span></button><button class="category-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-category="blog">Blog posts <span>3</span></button><button class="category-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-category="content">Content <span>2</span></button></div>
				<div class="editor-workspace card"><aside class="file-browser"><div class="file-browser-heading"><strong data-list-heading>Menus</strong><button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Add a file" data-action="new-file">＋</button></div><label class="search-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="5.5"/><path d="m13 13 4 4"/></svg><input type="search" placeholder="Filter files" aria-label="Filter files" data-file-search /></label><div class="file-list" role="listbox" aria-label="Repository content files"><button class="file-row is-selected" type="button" role="option" aria-selected="true" data-file="src/data/menus/main.yaml" data-kind="menus"><span class="file-mark yaml-mark">Y</span><span class="file-row-copy"><strong>main.yaml</strong><small>Main navigation</small></span></button><button class="file-row" type="button" role="option" aria-selected="false" data-file="src/content/blog/field-notes.md" data-kind="blog"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span class="file-row-copy"><strong>field-notes.md</strong><small>Field notes: spring</small></span></button><button class="file-row" type="button" role="option" aria-selected="false" data-file="src/content/blog/studio-journal.md" data-kind="blog"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span class="file-row-copy"><strong>studio-journal.md</strong><small>From the studio</small></span></button><button class="file-row" type="button" role="option" aria-selected="false" data-file="src/content/blog/weekend-notes.md" data-kind="blog"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span class="file-row-copy"><strong>weekend-notes.md</strong><small>A slower weekend</small></span></button><button class="file-row" type="button" role="option" aria-selected="false" data-file="src/content/pages/about.md" data-kind="content"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span class="file-row-copy"><strong>about.md</strong><small>About the studio</small></span></button><button class="file-row" type="button" role="option" aria-selected="false" data-file="src/content/pages/contact.md" data-kind="content"><span class="file-mark markdown-mark">M</span><span class="file-row-copy"><strong>contact.md</strong><small>Contact</small></span></button></div><div class="file-browser-footer"><span class="tiny-status-dot"></span><span>Sample repository</span><span>·</span><span data-visible-count>1 file</span></div></aside><div class="editor-panel"><div class="editor-toolbar"><div class="editor-file-title"><span class="file-mark yaml-mark" data-editor-mark>Y</span><span><strong data-editor-filename>main.yaml</strong><small data-editor-path>src/data/menus/main.yaml</small></span><i class="dirty-indicator" data-dirty-indicator hidden></i></div><div class="editor-toolbar-actions"><span class="editor-language" data-language>YAML</span><button class="button button-secondary button-small" type="button" data-action="save">Save draft</button></div></div><div class="editor-content"><div class="line-gutter" aria-hidden="true" data-line-gutter></div><textarea class="text-editor" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Edit selected source file" data-text-editor></textarea></div><div class="editor-status"><span><i></i> <span data-editor-status>Snapshot file</span></span><span>UTF-8 <b>·</b> Plain text</span></div><div class="commit-inline"><div><span class="commit-avatar">AL</span><span><strong>Ready to commit?</strong><small>Changes stay local until you download the repository.</small></span></div><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-action="commit">Commit locally</button></div></div></div>
				<div class="editor-footnote"><span class="info-icon">i</span><span>This is a UX mock. Text edits and local commits are simulated; they do not modify Git or survive a page reload.</span></div>
			</section>

			<section class="view-screen" data-screen="commits" hidden><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL GIT HISTORY</p><h1>Commits</h1><p class="subheading">A preview of the embedded repository’s current branch.</p></div><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-action="download"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v9m0 0 3-3m-3 3L7 9M4 14v3h12v-3"/></svg>Download repository</button></div><div class="git-state-bar"><span class="git-branch"><i>⑂</i> main</span><span class="git-state-divider"></span><span>Base <code>6f3a2c1</code></span><span class="git-state-divider"></span><span class="local-only"><i></i>No remote connection</span></div><div class="card history-card"><div class="history-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMIT HISTORY</p><h2 data-history-count>3 commits in snapshot</h2></div><span class="mock-label">SAMPLE HISTORY</span></div><div class="history-list" data-history-list><div class="history-entry"><span class="history-node current-node"></span><div class="history-entry-body"><strong>Initial Astro site</strong><p>Set up the base layout and homepage.</p><div><code>6f3a2c1</code><span>·</span><span>Alex Lee</span><span>·</span><span>2 days ago</span></div></div><span class="history-branch-line"></span></div><div class="history-entry"><span class="history-node"></span><div class="history-entry-body"><strong>Add content collections</strong><p>Introduce blog and page content sources.</p><div><code>4ca18de</code><span>·</span><span>Alex Lee</span><span>·</span><span>1 week ago</span></div></div><span class="history-branch-line"></span></div><div class="history-entry"><span class="history-node"></span><div class="history-entry-body"><strong>First commit</strong><p>Create the Astro project.</p><div><code>9e31b7a</code><span>·</span><span>Alex Lee</span><span>·</span><span>2 weeks ago</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="console-note card"><span class="console-icon">$</span><div><strong>Push from your console when you’re ready</strong><p>The downloaded ZIP contains a local `.git` repository and its working files.</p><code>git push origin main</code></div></div><div class="editor-footnote"><span class="info-icon">i</span><span>History shown here is sample data. This prototype does not create Git objects.</span></div></section>
		</div>
		<footer class="admin-footer"><span>Astro CMS · local-first editing</span><span>UX mock <i>•</i> No remote Git calls</span></footer>
	</main>
</div>

<dialog class="modal" data-dialog="download"><div class="modal-card"><button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close dialog" data-close>×</button><span class="modal-icon download-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M5 17v3h14v-3"/></svg></span><p class="eyebrow">EXPORT WORKING REPOSITORY</p><h2>Take your Git repository with you.</h2><p class="modal-copy">The planned ZIP contains the project files and `.git` history, including commits made in the browser. Push it from your console with your existing Git credentials.</p><div class="export-facts"><div><span>BRANCH</span><strong>main</strong></div><div><span>BASE HEAD</span><strong><code>6f3a2c1</code></strong></div><div><span>REMOTE</span><strong>origin · no credentials included</strong></div></div><div class="export-warning"><span>!</span><p>This is a UX mock. It does not create or download a repository archive.</p></div><button class="button button-primary modal-button" type="button" data-action="mock-download">Understood</button></div></dialog>

<dialog class="modal" data-dialog="commit"><form class="modal-card" data-commit-form><button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close dialog" data-close>×</button><span class="modal-icon commit-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="2"/><path d="M6 7v4a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4"/></svg></span><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL COMMIT</p><h2>Create a commit</h2><p class="modal-copy">This adds a commit to the embedded branch only. It does not contact the remote.</p><label for="commit-message">Commit message</label><input id="commit-message" name="message" required value="Update site content" /><label for="commit-author">Author</label><input id="commit-author" name="author" required value="Alex Lee &lt;alex@example.com&gt;" /><div class="export-warning"><span>!</span><p>Prototype only — no Git commit will be created.</p></div><button class="button button-primary modal-button" type="submit">Simulate local commit</button></form></dialog>

<dialog class="modal" data-dialog="new-file"><form class="modal-card" data-new-file-form><button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close dialog" data-close>×</button><span class="modal-icon new-file-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16M4 12h16"/></svg></span><p class="eyebrow">NEW CONTENT FILE</p><h2>Add a record</h2><p class="modal-copy">Create a sample menu, post, or page file in this prototype.</p><label for="new-file-title">Title</label><input id="new-file-title" name="title" required placeholder="A new story" /><label for="new-file-category">Content type</label><select id="new-file-category" name="category"><option value="blog">Blog post</option><option value="content">Generic content</option><option value="menus">Menu</option></select><div class="export-warning"><span>!</span><p>This adds a sample row only; no repository file is created.</p></div><button class="button button-primary modal-button" type="submit">Add sample record</button></form></dialog>

<div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-toast hidden></div>

<script>
	import './admin-mock.js';
</script>
